IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REWRITE-DEMO.
       AUTHOR. VALIDATION-PLATFORM.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT IDX-FILE ASSIGN TO "REWRITE.DAT"
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               RECORD KEY IS IDX-KEY
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  IDX-FILE.
       01  IDX-REC.
           05  IDX-KEY             PIC X(4).
           05  IDX-DATA            PIC X(20).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-FILE-STATUS      PIC X(2) VALUE "00".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "REWRITE DEMO STARTED".

           OPEN OUTPUT IDX-FILE.
           DISPLAY "OPEN OUTPUT STATUS=" WS-FILE-STATUS.

           MOVE "K001" TO IDX-KEY.
           MOVE "ORIGINAL-DATA-ONE--" TO IDX-DATA.
           WRITE IDX-REC.
           DISPLAY "WRITE K001 STATUS=" WS-FILE-STATUS.

           MOVE "K002" TO IDX-KEY.
           MOVE "ORIGINAL-DATA-TWO--" TO IDX-DATA.
           WRITE IDX-REC.
           DISPLAY "WRITE K002 STATUS=" WS-FILE-STATUS.

           CLOSE IDX-FILE.
           DISPLAY "CLOSE STATUS=" WS-FILE-STATUS.

           OPEN I-O IDX-FILE.
           DISPLAY "OPEN I-O STATUS=" WS-FILE-STATUS.

           MOVE "K001" TO IDX-KEY.
           MOVE "UPDATED-DATA-ONE---" TO IDX-DATA.
           REWRITE IDX-REC.
           DISPLAY "REWRITE K001 STATUS=" WS-FILE-STATUS.

           MOVE "K002" TO IDX-KEY.
           READ IDX-FILE.
           DISPLAY "READ K002 DATA=" IDX-DATA " STATUS=" WS-FILE-STATUS.

           MOVE "UPDATED-DATA-TWO---" TO IDX-DATA.
           REWRITE IDX-REC.
           DISPLAY "REWRITE K002 STATUS=" WS-FILE-STATUS.

           CLOSE IDX-FILE.
           DISPLAY "FINAL CLOSE STATUS=" WS-FILE-STATUS.

           STOP RUN.
